{
 "name": "VAOPGCPREC 25-90, Jul 17, 1990, Active Duty for VA Benefits - Reserve Duty as Flight Instructor",
 "content": "<p style=\"text-align: center\">\t<span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Decision Assessment Document<br />\tVAOPGCPREC 25-90,&nbsp;Jul 17, 1990, Active Duty for VA Benefits - Reserve Duty as Flight Instructor<br />\tOffice of General Counsel Precedent Opinion</span></span></p><p>\t&nbsp;</p><p>\t<strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">What the opinion is about:</span></span></strong></p><p>\t<span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Active Duty for VA Benefits - Reserve Duty as Flight Instructor.</span></span></p><p>\t<strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Impact on VBA:</span></span></strong></p><p>\t<span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">None.</span></span></p><p>\t<strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Summary of the facts and findings:</span></span></strong></p><p>\t<span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">See OGC opinion for facts. </span></span></p><p>\t<span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">The foregoing compels the conclusion that the military service performed by this individual July 1, 1973 to June 29, 1975, inclusive, was \"active duty\" under 38 U.S.C. \u00a7\u00a7 101(21)(A) and 1652(a).&nbsp;</span></span></p><p>\t<strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">References:</span></span></strong></p><p>\t<a href=\"http://www.va.gov/ogc/docs/1990/PREC_25-90.doc\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">http://www.va.gov/ogc/docs/1990/PREC_25-90.doc</span></span></a></p>",
